    "text": "Denise Michele Lynch | Richard J. Modell Funeral Home & Cremation Services - Homer Glen\nDenise Michele Lynch | Richard J. Modell Funeral Home & Cremation Services - Homer Glen\nDenise was a graduate of Lockport Township High School and had a distinguished career as a longtime secretary for the vice president of Nordstrom. She also worked at True the Vote. Private services will be held to honor Denise's memory.\nFor further information, contact the Richard J Modell Funeral Home & Cremation Services in Homer Glen. In memory of Denise Michele Lynch, contributions can be made through the sympathy store. Denise will be remembered for her love and dedication to her family.\nClick here to read the original obituary.",
